# spells -- the one strand for the one-word spells
# One fact per line. Add a new alias here and nowhere else. A later Glow core may lower this file to a Rye struct.
format spells-brix-v1
spell a suggest-only
spell i run-last
spell improve suggest-only
trigger i after a run-last-suggestion
trigger i after improve kg-step
trigger i after i kg-step
trigger chain a i a run-then-suggest
limit i never-chooses-removal
limit a never-acts
limit all counts-only-as-bare-line
trigger i fallback jena-suggestion-from-last-printed-lines
limit i fallback-suggests-only-in-the-jena-voice
alias kg i
alias g i
spell output-update project-measure-update-from-project-brix
spell o project-write-and-improve
limit o writes-the-unstored-learnings-into-tablecloth-before-the-push-so-the-record-outlives-the-reply
trigger i after o kg-step
limit o never-removes-content
trigger o send-push-to-xy-fast-forward-only
limit o push-never-goes-to-ww-and-never-force-pushes
trigger combo i-a run-last-then-suggest-next
combo i a valid-on-one-line-with-a-space
limit a runs-at-any-time
spell reduce rota-audit-queue-balanced-over-eight-themes
spell shed-prep prepare-for-shed-verify-the-prep-list-and-record-the-walk-back-cuts-nothing
limit shed-prep never-cuts-and-never-removes-a-file
spell r shed-prep-then-review-and-audit-with-the-rota-and-the-tame-core-audit-of-the-tracked-scripts
limit reduce single-strand-first-then-condense-then-molt-or-breach-never-shed
limit reduce suggests-the-queue-and-acts-on-nothing
alias b i
trigger i after b kg-step
trigger b after a suggest-then-one-build-suggestion
trigger i-a-chain every-i-a-run-ends-with-a-fresh-a-suggestion-so-the-next-i-a-has-something-to-run
trigger b-any any-b-command-may-follow-any-command
trigger g-any any-g-command-may-follow-any-command
combo a b valid-on-one-line-with-a-space
combo i b valid-on-one-line-with-a-space
spell br build-in-rishi-the-last-build-step-then-suggest-the-next-build-step
limit br acts-only-on-the-named-build-step-and-ends-with-one-build-suggestion
trigger br suggestion-at-end-like-b
combo b r build-in-rishi-the-last-build-step-then-suggest-the-next-build-step
trigger combo i-b run-last-then-suggest-expand-build-step
spell t reword-the-previous-output-in-twilight-style-and-offer-four-next-options-from-the-spells
limit t reads-the-scripts-and-changes-nothing
spell f forward
limit f changes-nothing
spell w publish-ww-as-one-snapshot-of-the-current-tree-after-a-checkpoint
limit w checkpoint-the-ww-head-first-and-never-removes-content
spell s z-study-then-l-r-a-t
spell bn b-for-nova-using-nova-and-s-l-r-o-w-beside
trigger s continue-the-last-s-if-s-was-the-very-last-command-else-draw-at-random
limit s reads-only-texts-accepted-in-study-manifest-md-never-outside-the-gate
spell * radiant-pass-over-living-pages-measured-against-the-gauge-ceiling-keeping-every-meaning
limit * never-touches-dated-testimony-and-never-removes-a-refusal-or-a-boundary
spell l learn-the-last-things-referenced-in-the-last-chat-output-down-to-their-dependencies
trigger l every-l-is-l-o-a-so-the-o-step-and-the-a-suggestion-follow-the-learning
limit l the-learning-reads-and-changes-nothing-until-the-o-step
spell m molt-the-last-referenced-then-run-l-r-l-o-a-with-r-as-construction-check-all-and-shed-rows-check
spell c continue-calfour-calendar-and-l-b
spell z run-the-spells-that-follow-within-the-named-path-folder
spell y r-15-rota-fifteen-themes
spell x r-8-rota-eight-themes
limit m molt-is-prep-on-a-referenced-file-never-a-cut-and-the-chain-keeps-its-own-limits
spell elder-learn read-the-elder-field-source-and-report-no-change
spell e explain-expand-and-explore-using-jena-bhakti-prema-for-radha-radiant-twilight-style-and-provide-a-suggestion
limit e reads-the-elder-and-acts-on-nothing

spell n nova
